{"synopsis":"Almamater, kampung halaman, ikatan darah—Semuanya hanya kepalsuan belaka!”\n\nPerang melawan organisasi kriminal yang dilancarkan oleh pemerintah telah gagal dengan menyedihkan…\n\nDunia pun berubah menjadi medan kekacauan yang dikuasai oleh tinju masing-masing.\n\nOrang yang menyatukan neraka ini, Presdir dari Taejin Group, “Jin Young-ui” telah memutuskan untuk menyelenggarakan sebuah kompetisi dengan nama “Festival Pendekar” untuk mencari seorang penerus.\n\nAkankah preman pengangguran kita, “Kang Daeoh” naik ke puncak piramida ini?!","alternative_title":"Namje, Festival of Warriors,","author":"Major","artist":"Yoon Young Il","chapters":[{"number":"68","chapter":"68","slug":"16220280-45a3-4e0e-9b0e-95e7987ac2aa","title":"Chapter 68","date":"2026-04-18"},{"number":"67","chapter":"67","slug":"9cc8e943-a484-404f-9e85-5aa122c0df36","title":"Chapter 67","date":"2026-04-18"},{"number":"66","chapter":"66","slug":"8317d9f1-2ddb-45ae-9904-4be8a94270b0","title":"Chapter 66","date":"2026-04-18"},{"number":"65","chapter":"65","slug":"8f581cd5-2f62-44a2-8b34-ba9eeb32319d","title":"Chapter 65","date":"2026-03-28"},{"number":"64","chapter":"64","slug":"4d6ff926-bf46-4314-b611-058aab6d1e47","title":"Chapter 64","date":"2026-03-25"},{"number":"63","chapter":"63","slug":"42ec37da-f40d-469d-8d18-fe54ed529843","title":"Chapter 63","date":"2026-03-19"},{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"cc7204f5-4ba5-43a8-8a0a-4a8cf280387a","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-03-16"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"ed14ad64-2eb3-4fab-ac11-ef6640133d07","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-03-03"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"831e2889-e15e-4f74-8ee6-e5752fc8da7b","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-03-03"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"240f5408-27f2-47dc-b16d-897e911464b6","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-01-27"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"e5b87af4-a917-4d01-9de7-c1427f0b045b","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-01-27"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"17b